West Germany has more than four million cars and trucks.

00:19:55.110 --> 00:19:56.390
most of which were built in Germany.

00:19:56.890 --> 00:19:59.670
jammed into an area smaller than the state of Oregon.

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:06.970
this constant flow of traffic winds its way along some of the finest highways to be found

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:14.400
anywhere in the world, the famous autobahns. Originally designed to expedite the movement

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:19.940
of military traffic, they provide Germany with one of the finest and fastest highway systems

00:20:19.940 --> 00:20:29.610
in the world today. South and to the east of Frankfurt,

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:35.540
Across the Necker River is the historic and colorful university city of Heidelberg.

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:42.420
Heidelberg is Germany's oldest university, having been established in 1385.

00:20:43.900 --> 00:20:48.610
To these halls of learning continue to come students from all the world.

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:55.590
Here are offered the arts and sciences of higher learning against a background of a university city

00:20:55.590 --> 00:20:59.980
which is known all the color and romance of an historic university.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:12.940
Germany, reaching deep into centuries gone by. No visit to West Germany would be complete without

00:21:12.940 --> 00:21:21.210
seeing the Black Forest, known as the Schwarzwald. The Black Forest is in the southern uplands region

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:29.810
of West Germany. This area is a tourist delight. There are fine roads and roadside rest houses which

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:31.880
They provide every comfort and convenience.

00:21:33.380 --> 00:21:35.800
Throughout the area are colorful villages,

00:21:36.330 --> 00:21:39.390
usually built alongside a clear-flowing mountain stream.

00:21:40.800 --> 00:21:45.200
These quaint and charming settlements serve mainly as holiday resorts

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:47.120
for visitors to the Black Forest,

00:21:47.730 --> 00:21:51.060
which is one of the great tourist attractions of West Germany.

00:21:57.790 --> 00:21:59.970
One of the major resorts of the Black Forest area...

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:05.940
area is Freudenstadt. The town was almost completely destroyed in the closing days of

00:22:05.940 --> 00:22:13.550
the war. Not a single wall was left standing. Today, Freudenstadt has been completely rebuilt

00:22:13.550 --> 00:22:19.870
on a larger scale than before, and has regained its position as one of Germany's outstanding

00:22:19.870 --> 00:22:27.020
therapeutic treatment centers and health resorts. More than 100,000 visitors come here every

00:22:27.020 --> 00:22:29.970
year, summer and winter, to...

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:45.380
enjoy a feeling of true holiday, relaxation, and happiness. In the Black Forest, as well as in many

00:22:45.380 --> 00:22:51.060
other parts of West Germany, there is always dancing to the lilting music of the harvest

00:22:51.060 --> 00:22:58.820
festivals, laughing to the distinctive tunes and tempos so long familiar to the Germany of yesterday.

00:23:01.120 --> 00:23:03.880
Dressed in the colorful costumes of their forefathers,

00:23:04.660 --> 00:23:08.160
this is a time to forget any problems of the workday world.

00:23:09.460 --> 00:23:12.310
In that dancing, in that laughter,

00:23:13.410 --> 00:23:15.890
their remains captured the color and romance

00:23:15.890 --> 00:23:18.590
of the Germany of days gone by,

00:23:19.480 --> 00:23:24.130
of hopes for the future of this land of romance and history.

00:23:39.120 --> 00:23:49.470
South of the Black Forest, just across the border in Switzerland, is one of the outstanding attractions in all of Europe, the Great Waterfall at Schaffhausen.

00:23:52.720 --> 00:23:59.980
This is part of the River Rhine, a few miles upstream from Basel, where the navigable part of the river...

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:00.300
begins.

00:24:01.750 --> 00:24:02.230
We'll be right back.

00:24:02.620 --> 00:24:03.600
Thank you.

00:24:08.530 --> 00:24:09.910
Here is where this river...

00:24:10.300 --> 00:24:11.900
which has its beginning in the Alps.

00:24:12.440 --> 00:24:14.960
first shows its real force and stature.

00:24:15.830 --> 00:24:17.130
where it gains true momentum.

00:24:17.660 --> 00:24:20.880
for its continued course on its way to become Europe's...

00:24:21.050 --> 00:24:22.210
greatest working river.

00:24:22.940 --> 00:24:24.160
And then to finally...

00:24:24.440 --> 00:24:25.100
Meet the sea.

00:24:25.500 --> 00:24:26.480
Thank you.

00:24:31.240 --> 00:24:33.200
When viewing the West Germany of today,

00:24:34.060 --> 00:24:37.120
Consider the ruin that was the Germany of 1945.

00:24:39.180 --> 00:24:41.760
Then consider the Federal Republic of today.

00:24:42.860 --> 00:24:43.400
Rebuilt.

00:24:44.300 --> 00:24:45.180
No unemployment.

00:24:46.340 --> 00:24:49.880
Her factory's turning out more than double the output of 1936.

00:24:51.340 --> 00:24:53.800
Her currency, one of the soundest in the world.

00:24:55.780 --> 00:24:57.120
At the rate they have recovered,

00:24:57.800 --> 00:24:59.940
It should not be too long before the future.

00:25:00.000 --> 00:25:01.100
of all of Germany.

00:25:01.820 --> 00:25:03.400
and to a degree that of her neighbors.

00:25:04.570 --> 00:25:07.910
could rest largely in the hands of the West Germans.

00:25:09.560 --> 00:25:12.160
It will be interesting to see what they make of their future.

00:25:12.920 --> 00:25:13.400
This time.

00:25:13.810 --> 00:25:14.790
Thank you.

00:25:29.080 --> 00:25:29.940
Germany is among.

00:25:30.000 --> 00:25:33.120
monumental example of the real force of the rights of the individual.

00:25:33.800 --> 00:25:36.320
and a free enterprise in creating a way of life.

00:25:37.160 --> 00:25:40.420
as contrasted to the system imposed upon the socialistic states.

00:25:41.480 --> 00:25:42.800
The future status of Berlin.

00:25:43.400 --> 00:25:44.380
and of Germany itself.

00:25:44.900 --> 00:25:45.900
Remains to be decided.

00:25:46.600 --> 00:25:49.060
and upon those decisions could conceivably

00:25:49.390 --> 00:25:52.470
Rest the future of the world for a long time to come.

00:25:53.580 --> 00:25:55.280
This is John Cameron Swayze saying,

00:25:55.880 --> 00:25:56.740
Goodbye for now.
